});
```

But defend has no count; setting count 0 harmless. Boss no count. Rescue no count. Fine.

Alternatively fix config to use amount. Better to normalize for robustness. Also brief objectives display uses m.objectives and panelBriefing probably handles `count` labels only, no numbers. Fine.

